# The unlock cost is paid by a special action (CR 709.5e, 116.2), which is no activated ability, so what makes activated
# abilities cost more does not touch it. Bot2's Anointed Peacekeeper names Unholy Annex (one of the two names of the card in Bot1's
# hand, CR 709.4a): "activated abilities of sources with the chosen name cost {2} more" would make the unlock cost {5}{2}, and Bot1 has
# exactly five mana sources on turn 3. The unlock is offered and taken at its printed {3}{B}{B}.
# Bot1 cast Unholy Annex on turn 1 with Black Lotus; Bot2 casts the Peacekeeper on turn 2 with Black Lotus and Mox Pearl.

